      "id": "sol.ahsme-1991-p6.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Starting inside and using fractional exponents, \\[ \\begin{aligned} \\sqrt{x\\sqrt{x\\sqrt{x}}} &=\\sqrt{x\\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{4}}}\\\\ &=x^{\\frac{7}{8}} =\\sqrt[8]{x^7}. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Work from the innermost square root outward",
        "Rewrite each square root as a power of \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)"
      ],
